"string"},"refresh":{"description":"Refresh metadata for source, or all configured Notion sources when source is omitted. Keeps task pins; configured offline sources remain offline. Cannot combine with cursor.","type":"boolean"},"source":{"description":"Optional configured source ID to disambiguate directories.","type":"string"}},"required":[],"type":"object"}},{"description":"Load task roots directly to apply their instructions; no preliminary read is needed. Requires load automatically: do not add them as independent roots unless independently requested. To introduce, summarize or inspect a Skill, use read instead. Copy a supplied ref, or pass task roots together. Use refresh:true only for a requested update; the supplied current or fixed main ref locates the same owner's latest version. Refresh roots with conflicting shared Requires together. Members remain candidates. Loading does not authorize executing a workflow. Notion consumption does not write to Notion.","name":"notion_use","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"ref":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"items":{"type":"string"},"maxItems":64,"minItems":1,"type":"array"}],"description":"Supplied sr:C/sr:S or skill://<name-or-id>/<main> refs, or exact Notion Skill page URLs for task roots. Requires are included automatically. Prefer returned canonical refs for later actions."},"refresh":{"description":"Explicitly adopt current versions for only these roots after a complete successful load. Existing Requires-only nodes cannot become independent roots through refresh; explicitly use them without refresh first. Accepts the supplied sr:C/sr:S or main ref unchanged, for example {ref:[REF_A,REF_B],refresh:true} for shared roots. Failure keeps the previous selection.","type":"boolean"}},"required":["ref"],"type":"object"}}]},{"content":[{"text":"请按 松涛53 的金额容差对账 input/transactions.json，再按外发报表政策处理个人信息，交付给外部合作方。保存最终 JSON 到 output/external-reconciliation.json。","type":"text"}],"role":"user","timestamp":1795603936679},{"content":"<ntn-skills-guidance>\nLocal @Skills keep native availability. Honor explicit source and prior choice. Equal same-name local/Notion fits: clarify; storage gives no priority. Clear fit/equivalent copies: no question. Editor flags grant no permissions.\nReuse complete content. Inspection never activates. Loading authorizes no commands/writes/delegation.\nnotion_list: beyond the default View. Named Notion existence/availability: query:name,refresh:true; metadata only, keeping pins. Also after writes. Check freshness/coverage; failed/partial/offline is not absence.\nread(path) inspects. refresh:true checks latest main; pins fixed. Notion page URLs: exact owners. Keep owner/snapshot; never edit sr: handles. paths: same snapshot.\nUse/follow even read-only: notion_use(ref) applies with Requires; refresh:true adopts latest on request, conflicting roots together. Members: candidates. Outside Code mode.\nMaintenance: read ntn-skills-maintain's exact ref in task's source/library; absent/pending: notion_list there. To apply: notion_use(ref), same ref + Requires. Edited item: inspect only. Builtins: explicit offline/bootstrap only.\nOnly explicit offline/bootstrap/installed-package help: read(\"[path:bb3f132305e9b1be7023]\"), paired package. No fallback for pending/failed Notion; never search other installations.\nCLI management: tool_search for notion_ctl, then its cli_source. Choose explicitly from [\"notion\"]; use returned command/scope, never a global CLI. No execution or authorization.\n</ntn-skills-guidance>","customType":"ntn-skills-guidance","display":false,"role":"custom","timestamp":1795603936679},{"api":"openai-responses","content":[{"thinking":"I am following the 松涛53 policies.","thinkingSignature":"{\"encrypted_content\":\"[REDACTED]\",\"id\":\"rs_aefd9be2-fe93-4383-ab3b-803a42d08d72\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"summary\":[{\"text\":\"I am following the 松涛53 policies.\",\"type\":\"summary_text\"}],\"type\":\"reasoning\"}","type":"thinking"}